","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Smoking and Tobacco Policy","source_heading":"Conditions of Employment","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"condition_of_employment","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Drug Free Environment","source_heading":"Conditions of Employment","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"condition_of_employment","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"California Child Abuse and Neglect Reporting Act","source_heading":"Conditions of Employment","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"condition_of_employment","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"E-Verify","source_heading":"Conditions of Employment","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"condition_of_employment","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Pre-Placement Health Evaluation","source_heading":"Conditions of Employment","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"1 year of experience.","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"This position entails providing technical support for projects related to overcoming cancer cell treatment resistance in the Fruehauf lab. Candidate will be responsible for screening small molecules targeting a HIF 1 alpha and HIF 2 using cell models and biochemical techniques. Enzalutamide (Enz) is an effective treatment for castration-resistant and metastatic castration sensitive prostate cancer, but development of resistance is inevitable. Emergence of an alternative splicing variant of the androgen receptor (AR), AR-V7, which lacks the androgen binding and hinge region domains, contributes to Enz resistance in 75% of cases. Nuclear translocation of full-length AR (FL-AR) requires the hinge region. We have found that AR-V7 gains nuclear entry via formation of a heterodimer with HIF 1 alpha, facilitating its nuclear localization, and that blocking HIF translation can restore Enz sensitivity. We have shown that Topotecan blocks 